      "message": "[error] Line 1137: 🔴 `av_assert0(n_planes \u003c\u003d AV_DRM_MAX_PLANES)` can abort the whole process on malformed/unexpected PipeWire input. This is externally supplied data, so this must be a runtime validation path instead of a hard assert. Replace with an explicit bounds check, log an error, recycle the buffer, and return to avoid a crash/DoS vector.",
      "revId": "4bb310340791bca59c6af870b17b3e550d62eebc",
